{
  "sn12.12:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.12 ",
  "sn12.12:0.2": "2. Āhāravagga ",
  "sn12.12:0.3": "Moḷiyaphaggunasutta ",
  "sn12.12:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.12:1.2": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, āhārā bhūtānaṁ vā sattānaṁ ṭhitiyā sambhavesīnaṁ vā anuggahāya. ",
  "sn12.12:1.3": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "sn12.12:1.4": "Kabaḷīkāro āhāro oḷāriko vā sukhumo vā, phasso dutiyo, manosañcetanā tatiyā, viññāṇaṁ catutthaṁ. ",
  "sn12.12:1.5": "Ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro āhārā bhūtānaṁ vā sattānaṁ ṭhitiyā sambhavesīnaṁ vā anuggahāyā”ti. ",
  "sn12.12:2.1": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā moḷiyaphagguno bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn12.12:2.2": "“ko nu kho, bhante, viññāṇāhāraṁ āhāretī”ti? ",
  "sn12.12:2.3": "“No kallo pañho”ti bhagavā avoca: ",
  "sn12.12:2.4": "“‘āhāretī’ti ahaṁ na vadāmi. ",
  "sn12.12:2.5": "‘Āhāretī’ti cāhaṁ vadeyyaṁ, tatrassa kallo pañho: ",
  "sn12.12:2.6": "‘ko nu kho, bhante, āhāretī’ti? ",
  "sn12.12:2.7": "Evañcāhaṁ na vadāmi. ",
  "sn12.12:2.8": "Evaṁ maṁ avadantaṁ yo evaṁ puccheyya: ",
  "sn12.12:2.9": "‘kissa nu kho, bhante, viññāṇāhāro’ti, esa kallo pañho. ",
  "sn12.12:2.10": "Tatra kallaṁ veyyākaraṇaṁ: ",
  "sn12.12:2.11": "‘viññāṇāhāro āyatiṁ punabbhavābhinibbattiyā paccayo, tasmiṁ bhūte sati saḷāyatanaṁ, saḷāyatanapaccayā phasso’”ti. ",
  "sn12.12:3.1": "“Ko nu kho, bhante, phusatī”ti?